      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Inflammation is a critical pathogenic component in acute coronary syndromes. As a consequence the potential use of inflammatory markers as predictors of clinical outcome in acute coronary syndromes has been investigated. This review outlines the pathology underlying acute coronary syndromes and reviews the published data on inflammatory markers in acute coronary syndromes."},
